# Development Workflow (Core)

**Rule: build screen by screen, run, test, then continue.**

Do not write large code blocks in one pass and break the build.

## Step-by-Step

1. Complete one logical step (e.g. UI layout, then ViewModel wiring)
2. Build: `./gradlew :composeApp:assembleDebug`
3. Fix all compile errors before moving on
4. Repeat for the next step or screen

## Do / Don't

```
❌ BAD — write Domain + Data + UI + Navigation in one batch, ignore build errors
✅ GOOD — UI shell → build → ViewModel + UseCase → build → Route → build
```

Never ignore a build failure and keep coding. Stabilize the project first.
